			x: 6.0d,
			y: 0.0d,
			title: "Place it and stock the chests",
			description: ["Hold the blueprint and right-click the ground where the front should go: you see the building as see-through blocks, and the gold edge is the front. Sneak-right-click the ground to turn it.", "", "Put the materials in chests or barrels within 8 blocks of the Blueprint Table. Hold Shift over the blueprint for the list; once placed, its tooltip shows only what's still missing."],
