			x: 8.0d,
			y: 0.0d,
			title: "Hand it over",
			description: ["Right-click the builder with the blueprint. They clear the ground, lay a foundation, put up the walls and roof, add the doors, beds and torches, and tidy the ground round it.", "", "What they're doing and what they're waiting for floats over their head. Sneak-right-click them with an empty hand for the full story."],
