			title: "Upgrades",
			description: ["Most buildings have a bigger version: the Starter Cottage II adds an upper story. Once a builder finishes a building with an upgrade, they sell its blueprint.", "", "Right-click the finished building with the upgrade: it lines up exactly over it, and the builder only changes what's new."],
